  "entries": [
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7007a6c3f64fbc7925ae2391",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘初期的某处位于中后方时\\n加速度稍微提升＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "54be68673ea7841a2e31d5d26b398946662a877140d4832d0f0a4ef20ca95ccf",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204672"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:15da4f7a49d4ffd7c62ef36b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的某处位于中后方时\\n稍微消耗耐力使速度稍微提升\\n＜短距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "63b7ac409c015345bb83b6d8d2f56f21745c8b8c5dc791c92a84101568d3cc4e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204682"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:b9c161cd0db2187227cd38dd",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘位于前方进行名次争夺时\\n向前突进＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "b23924ec36d3a86d3be9ea427cf6fce540125ce0954fd256064c65c7fa3a9152",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204691"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1ac7c594fba7e5bdbd20e81",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘位于前方进行名次争夺时\\n稍微向前突进＜英里/中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "446d9513dc728e8a7611f2af11353b2aa77583b2432a7734df9d7bf39303f7cb",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204692"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0a044d27c1f0c5a43f9e9773",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的随机位置一段时间内\\n小幅向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "b13f97ec172e5aeec758dcf79d7d4d18c3960dbbf28219d956ae9beeb97b2f66",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204701"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:ab660b5715f7ad878381c95b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的随机位置一段时间内\\n稍微向前突进",
      "source_fingerprint": "f26c9f421e753dbe5cf2f6effd976e7d423058919b007efff4e1ed888fff36fd",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204702"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:9666723af9e408aa3569c16b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘某处向前突进\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "e39dad5a7abdada63e3564cad17243c679c73ee158276f9593985c0682bb7037",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204711"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:06d62a57501d2837472ff0d5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘某处稍微向前突进\\n＜作战・居中＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "251ab48dba4668e29d4fba5e9bf94acdfce578653f70c3d47d1ab4cea9e59c08",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204712"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5a11951788e92bc5ff638fb0",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的某处提升速度\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "010bbd72da61511591b81040b3a531bd42ded0d982fabdc1fc6842a887fb1b6d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204721"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b926fd2175aa38756f225a3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘的某处速度\\n少量提升＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "172dd92c8e0ca5a402c18a51b69fab0de8825378ffe8efd9db09312c59cb3b14",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204722"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:20c5bb51d1cb82d7cd9cc900",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段准备超越\\n或被逼近时，一段时间内速度提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "bcbdf177ad3e1273832de3f01f0dd47fe04478253c64e95478493b232877ee0a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204731"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:aaa424dc2bd3b369c5d31223",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛后半段准备超越\\n或被逼近时，一段时间内速度略微提升\\n＜中距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "d30e6d5bef3830d74ca1de517c261a1676b6b50c22a93cfeedf24d06f015390e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204732"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b703451a3aa3ebd23fb8239",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘或中盘被超越\\n或发生冲刺对抗时向前突进\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "3ecd7b909256030b894f437271d50e2f601881115e69b1d806ae6ca1509d1e9b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204741"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c276fad1c1110f1557d57397",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛序盘或中盘被超越\\n或发生冲刺对抗时稍微向前突进\\n＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "f00498b6d162659a481f0c430218385d3750be9cd9324a558ab8c6ec1dc5d225",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204742"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d6b314b9a925e56bf40392ce",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "055f319c867400276b7fc22e27f0b09433a0235afabd32446ad22ef8f48b169c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204751"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d477c04098be9a8760cf6b6a",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛中盘时若身处前方\\n则速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "ad75d8e6157418d38e7bea0fe6df87dd6e5039c8da9b7bd899a91d7022a39025",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204752"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:524a31cd69f357cc1ca695f5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在全开冲刺的关键时刻\\n稍微展现冲劲＜长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "da122375667a237bcddf6fe5b4ab61ee3d32a8484f064a8a06e651d01dd8a134",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204762"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:3c8687b251ba4f7177d8a7a9",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "若速度有十二分强劲超则速度\\n略微提升，若智力也有十二分高超\\n则速度少量提升＜中距离/长距离＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "49b500b6b95a52676cf97449892df76184cb49bfed9442f9d625985353b3fd73",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204792"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d1607cfa239c679d7c3a0c7e",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘进行超越时\\n向前突进＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "77d6cd8a84ae292fde4dd1dc8ad62cf139906df85c993ef6dd43b5b74b2ecd81",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204801"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:00c55fd207ab3e7865383ef5",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘进行超越时\\n稍微向前突进＜作战・追赶＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "95190f9bb4e27a01e5c989cd36f63a93caea854b40eedc0d24e5cbca11767715",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204802"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d80b08a7fde00b4734a7624c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在任意弯道的某一处\\n速度提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "e4243664ef95945eaa9b17aa91434ba36d5048a1c2f0dcafc75402fed07cbb2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204811"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:f5516a491710d4cd2fa812e3",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在任意弯道的某一处\\n速度稍微提升",
      "source_fingerprint": "98d8d2ff13b6f9f59832b93a2855c6efaa428750fdf537f20b60cbdf33fa3ee8",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204812"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d7b1288ddf8dffaf8b3d9fcf",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "比赛中盘速度稍微提升，\\n若未晚出闸则速度提升\\n＜作战・领放＞",
      "source_fingerprint": "90772589a786c1e41a6545316e70810c493da59fd9dd211e941eb233ff16d266",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "204892"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:be89826044140681a6c1c9a8",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘燃烧青春之魂加快速度\\n参赛队友的速度属性总和越高\\n越能提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "8b8024240132d6ba201d8225fec10b7da0554e8b5a59a85e034eb6127d4974ce",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210011"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:8b3250b2b9fcbd352cd76c76",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘燃烧青春之魂略微加快速度\\n参赛队友的速度属性总和越高\\n越能提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "3536bdfadc6ca29b578aeef51ebbc750a82c678850eb0ebbe4439a4d508eb6ee",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210012"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:5ae6e2ffe8363a9fd6a447ba",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘燃烧青春之魂回复持久力\\n参赛队友的耐力属性总和越高\\n越能回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "b53680186b77d935932fc5159275651bc53e6881903b9193756fd411ba133c2f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210021"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:0dd0577cb033956f363b621c",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛中盘燃烧青春之魂略微回复持久力\\n参赛队友的耐力属性总和越高\\n越能回复持久力",
      "source_fingerprint": "d3d209e3ee20a7a1301a78060510928bce563e3eb21c2e0bf352fff975a798e4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210022"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a8c2fe50c347faadc9eb78d7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘燃烧青春之魂提高加速度\\n参赛队友的力量属性总和越高\\n越能提高加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "19b9b0af48547df32309bfe844df33ed9c7fcd1af24b8eb9cb0ba207e56302f6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210031"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:1e17ceb9e94410237048063b",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘燃烧青春之魂提高加速度\\n参赛队友的力量属性总和越高\\n越能少量提高加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "5a0d4bda23cf38ff950741a799b11ea1963747c6cd443a87894d1ba5e74a3b2a",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210032"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:033bbbf9a922a97885e821aa",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘燃烧青春之魂为脚部注入力量\\n参赛队友的毅力属性总和越高\\n越能提升速度与加速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "7845745af34e66f3496e5798fc20636ff7bb5e8082cf05d35224c07d6e0424a4",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210041"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:117b3c7cfd7255cb4c60ce43",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛终盘燃烧青春之魂略微为脚部注入力量\\n参赛队友的毅力属性总和越高\\n速度与加速度提升越多",
      "source_fingerprint": "a771ce1837fa8fb6b3326c4f2a61fd592cf4dd3df6e903ab50c180e4dd8a6d8f",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210042"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:45ebe041359b690a31ef3101",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘燃烧青春之魂展望赛道\\n参赛队友的智力属性总和越高\\n路线的规划越高效",
      "source_fingerprint": "ac55c00466b405dbc676c6a01921d54f415206ffc928be7bf69e497c947db5b6",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210051"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:bb0b19485b7fe20b5b435115",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "在比赛序盘燃烧青春之魂略微展望赛道\\n参赛队友的智力属性总和越高\\n路线的规划越高效",
      "source_fingerprint": "7f7a1c3b464f65348a292d37d0247617cffc7dd3bbbf3eef4212d277796c9827",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210052"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:a72891c00a34636800e51593",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半调整呼吸并向前迈进\\n育成中积累的胜利次数越多\\n速度、加速度、耐力回复量越高",
      "source_fingerprint": "678ac4ea98c47e1b124683151a4f3b4d1512e031aecc715090041acda0f0ce15",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210061"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:7816705527b14a71b807a3fe",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半调整呼吸并稍微向前迈进\\n育成中积累的胜利次数越多\\n速度、加速度、耐力回复量越高",
      "source_fingerprint": "2e27846c02dc3fd929062250a878620af94d76b827b0458277c0b51db15e2f7b",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210062"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:25d1837748a0aa86a0d08862",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半若位于前方则速度提高\\n加速度稍微提高\\n粉丝越多,效果越好",
      "source_fingerprint": "2f19232274687c0e637e85448ab354a9fd7cdfc208f1e5b7ca9714c2428d44de",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210071"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:19f19202cf7d7a86895ce5f7",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "赛程后半若位于前方则速度稍微提高\\n加速度略微提高\\n粉丝越多,效果越好",
      "source_fingerprint": "ec4b46213e22aba9a11c2f75b58d2c65c5797e01f5c9c3ed4a07aafd75c65a3e",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210072"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:550b41eb303a0759f5ed0d23",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时速度提升\\n并根据最高基础能力值提升效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "d6d79ed1897b3ad4c793f5f353ba7737d84185eee25605d8123b05cfe235581c",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210081"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:d5c977c8ca5d3222a874df3f",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时速度稍微提升\\n并根据最高基础能力值提升效果",
      "source_fingerprint": "baf92ef851fde4c0994fed2ec8bd2a73ea51441b750806232052ad16ae53802d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210082"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:6282afc895ef457f5cea32bb",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "临近比赛终盘时\\n少量提升速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "8446bf20485d75d67fc0b8b103901c48a71dc2f0f2d8424d72602447fd5b6a7d",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210091"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:722f7b6d7085de501fc2e745",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺时消耗少量体力\\n提升少量速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "9a50b0d5ef953a1cefa4d7555a40205c0878e1a0e1ca3992266b9cf29fd366a1",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
        "210101"
      ]
    },
    {
      "uid": "zhcn:c8aad02ace4a53c06ebfab10",
      "kind": "text_data",
      "source_text": "最后冲刺要超越对手时\\n短时间内提升少量速度",
      "source_fingerprint": "a6f93a20d4b85139fb4b6056e90291d3464be15baafb7e346e9e71a08465cf12",
      "source_path": "text_data_dict.json",
      "json_path": [
        "48",
